# Ride along the 0.45 m ledge with it on the left (regular: back to it), ollie, press grind (I) with no direction: BS 50-50 to the end, roll off, land.
park lab
cmd 0 teleport 0 -0.6 0.14 90
hold up 6..100
hold ollie 90..105
tap grind 176
bot balance
run 560
expect event grindStart{trick=BS 50-50,slide=false} within 172..190
expect event grindEnd{trick=BS 50-50,reason=end} within 300..460
expect event comboLanded{name=BS 50-50} within 300..520
expect no event bail
expect no event danger
